  "name": null,
  "problem": "Find the radius of gyration ${R}_{y}$ of the plate about the $y$-axis.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${R}_{y}\\,=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "For a plane lamina in the shape of a region $D$ with mass $M$ and mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ the radius of gyration ${R}_{y}$ about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{R}_{y}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{y}}{M}},\n$$\n\nwhere ${I}_{y}$ is the moment of inertia about the $y$-axis.\n\nIn part 1, we found that the mass of the plate is\n\n$$\nM=24.\n$$\n\nAlso, from part 5, we know that the moment of inertia of the lamina about the $y$-axis is \n\n$$\n{I}_{y}=108.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the radius of gyration about the $y$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{y} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{y}}{M}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{108}{24}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{9}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
